WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:03,365
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,415 --> 00:00:05,649
This is Episode 43.

3
00:00:05,699 --> 00:00:07,497
Maya made a drawing.

4
00:00:07,547 --> 00:00:09,522
Then clouds roll in.

5
00:00:09,572 --> 00:00:11,037
Pebbles fall.

6
00:00:11,087 --> 00:00:13,652
A muddy blob wobbles up the street.

7
00:00:13,702 --> 00:00:14,878
Oh no!

8
00:00:14,928 --> 00:00:17,058
Four helpers to the rescue.

9
00:00:17,108 --> 00:00:19,425
The scramble lock clicks on.

10
00:00:19,475 --> 00:00:21,803
Her sun turns to squiggles.

11
00:00:21,853 --> 00:00:23,806
Nobody can read it now.

12
00:00:23,856 --> 00:00:26,277
The whisper jar opens a crack.

13
00:00:26,327 --> 00:00:28,270
It tells her the secret.

14
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,201
Nobody else hears.

15
00:00:30,251 --> 00:00:32,547
The sieve gate lets Maya through.

16
00:00:32,597 --> 00:00:34,893
The muddy blob bounces off.

17
00:00:34,943 --> 00:00:36,160
Splat!

18
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:37,987
Pebbles rain down.

19
00:00:38,037 --> 00:00:40,333
The big umbrella pops open.

20
00:00:40,383 --> 00:00:42,233
Not one gets through.

21
00:00:42,283 --> 00:00:43,582
Scramble.

22
00:00:43,632 --> 00:00:44,818
Whisper.

23
00:00:44,868 --> 00:00:45,949
Sieve.

24
00:00:45,999 --> 00:00:47,278
Umbrella.

25
00:00:47,328 --> 00:00:49,188
That is the safety net.

26
00:00:49,238 --> 00:00:54,285
Now you know KMS, Secrets Manager, WAF, and Shield!

27
00:00:54,335 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
